GeoCeDG project licensing status

NO PROJECT-WIDE LICENSE HAS YET BEEN APPROVED FOR GEOCEDG.

This file is not a license grant. It records an unresolved release gate so that
internal evaluation packages cannot be mistaken for authorized public
distributions.

Inherited source files and third-party components retain their original
copyright notices and applicable terms. GeoGebra-authored source is recorded
as EUPL-1.2 in the repository component matrix, while translations, UI assets,
fonts, native libraries, trademarks, and other components may have different
terms. GeoCeDG-authored material has no approved project-wide license yet.

INTERNAL EVALUATION — NOT FOR REDISTRIBUTION

See LICENSES/README.md, NOTICE.md, THIRD_PARTY.md, and
docs/licensing/component-matrix.md. Human legal and asset approval is required
before any public redistribution.
